@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-65 - View User Stats

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Analytics UI" as FE
control "AnalyticsController" as API
control "AnalyticsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-65
FE -> API: GET /analytics/overview
API -> Service: Execute View User Stats
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Thống kê user hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở dashboard
Post: Thống kê user hiển thị
Main flow:
1. System trả về: totalUsers, newUsers by day/week, user roles breakdown
2. Hiển thị line chart + pie chart
end note
@enduml
